$Aeon::Books["zAdmin","cntnt"] = "If you have any further questions, and feel it would be best to ask another player about it, these people very knowledgable and experienced players: <f2>[RR]Mister Pibb<f1>, <f2>Ares<f1>, <f2>CURT<f1>, <f2>Number9<f1>, and of course the creator himself: <f2>Ice<f1>, however <f2>Ice<f1> is usually very busy working on the mod, trying to make sure it is working and fun to play, so always consult the Library first, then one of the other players second, and finally if all else fails, maybe ask Ice. It is requested that all of these veteran players be treated with respect, because had it not been for them, the mod would not exist, so make sure you tell them 'Thank You!' whenever you see them!";